 "segments": [
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Unable to chop off his own finger, Senya convinces the guys to tie him up instead, and when they run out to the alley, produce supplier Timur offers them a ride to safety — for a fee.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ладно, ребята, давайте сделаем иначе.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Вы меня просто крепко свяжите.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Вдруг я ещё не превращусь?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Или учёные вакцину скоро придумают.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "А пристрелить меня всегда успеете.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Держите его крепче, ребята!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Зомби уже ломают двери!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "timur",
   "t": "Давайте все быстрее в фургон!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "timur",
   "t": "Я отвезу вас в безопасную зону.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "timur",
   "t": "По восемьсот рублей у всех есть?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Тимур, ты и сейчас торгуешься?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "timur",
   "t": "Бензин сейчас очень дорогой, брат.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let's examine each line as Senya bargains for his life and Timur names his price.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ладно, ребята, давайте сделаем иначе.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'All right, guys, let's do it differently.' The adverb 'differently/otherwise' proposes a less painful plan.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Вы меня просто крепко свяжите.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Just tie me up tightly.' The imperative with prefix 's-' means 'bind/tie together'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Вдруг я ещё не превращусь?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What if I do not turn into one after all?' At the start of a question, the word for 'suddenly' means 'what if?'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Или учёные вакцину скоро придумают.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Or scientists will invent a vaccine soon.' The perfective future verb means 'will think up' or 'invent'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "А пристрелить меня всегда успеете.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And you will always have time to shoot me.' The verb 'you will be in time' pairs with the infinitive.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Держите его крепче, ребята!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Hold him tighter, guys!' The comparative adverb 'tighter/stronger' modifies the plural command 'hold'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Зомби уже ломают двери!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'The zombies are already breaking down the doors!' The plural present-tense verb describes the attackers breaking through.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "timur",
   "t": "Давайте все быстрее в фургон!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Everyone get into the van quickly!' Motion into a vehicle uses the preposition 'into' plus the accusative case.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "timur",
   "t": "Я отвезу вас в безопасную зону.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I will drive you to the safe zone.' The prefixed transport verb means 'I will drive/deliver you there'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "timur",
   "t": "По восемьсот рублей у всех есть?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Does everyone have eight hundred rubles each?' Even during the end of the world, businessman Timur uses the distributive preposition 'po' to charge a fare per person.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Тимур, ты и сейчас торгуешься?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Timur, are you bargaining even now?' The reflexive verb means to haggle or bargain over prices.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "timur",
   "t": "Бензин сейчас очень дорогой, брат.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
